// Exhaustive semantic-AST inventory for slang v11.0.
//
// SLANG_AST_NODE(Category, dispatch kind, concrete C++ type)
// The invalid statement and expression sentinels are deliberately absent:
// compilation errors prevent IR emission and explicit visitor overloads reject
// them. Every other concrete ASTVisitor dispatch case is represented.

